data: {"id": "85527a5a2a8343a0-thinking-layer-237", "run_id": "85527a5a2a8343a0", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 状态为 `Pending`，未绑定节点。这通常与调度失败（`PendingUnschedulable`）或卷挂载失败（`VolumeMountFailed`）有关。\n\n我将获取 `pod-pending-unschedulable.md` 运行手册来指导后续的诊断步骤，因为这是 `Pending` 状态最常见的原因。同时，为了全面性，我也会检查是否有卷相关的问题迹象，但首先从调度问题入手。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789115737210}

