data: {"id": "85527a5a2a8343a0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1869", "run_id": "85527a5a2a8343a0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "**关键事实已获取。**\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes (kubectl_describe)\n- Pod `workload` (uid `b2f83678-483c-4854-b4a8-02515010c20d`) 状态为 **Pending**，`node: <none>`。\n- **Events**：两次 `FailedScheduling` 警告（首次 33 分钟前，后续 5 次），原因一致：\n  > `persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found`\n- **Volumes 定义**：Volume `input` 引用 PVC `unavailable-claim`。\n- **Selectors/Tolerations**：无 NodeSelector，仅有默认的 `not-ready` toleration。\n- **Resources**：Requests cpu 5m / memory 8Mi，Limits cpu 50m / memory 32Mi。资源需求极低，3 个节点均满足。\n- **", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789115787659, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

